    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In this thesis I empirically investigate whether bidders are maximizing their return on investment (ROI) across multiple keywords in sponsored search auctions. I classify bidders based on the minimum perturbations that must be applied to their bids in order for various conditions to be satisfied.\r\nI show that a large fraction of bidders in the Yahoo Webscope first price data set may be following ROI-based strategies.",
